 original files.","docs/research/30-presets-samples.md#42-how-a-project-points-at-a-preset-decoded-xy",{"id":48,"text":49,"source":50,"firmware_min":23,"verified_on":26,"confidence":31},"octave","A copied and pasted track takes its active octave along.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.0.38",{"id":52,"text":53,"source":54,"firmware_min":24,"verified_on":26,"confidence":31},"paste-fix","OS 1.1.32 fixed pasted tracks sometimes missing some of their settings.","https://teenage.engineering/downloads/op-xy#1.1.32",[56,62],{"id":36,"goal":57,"preconditions":58,"steps":59,"result":26,"source":30,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":31},"Save the selected track's sound as a new preset",[],[60],{"keys":61,"note":26,"set":26},"Tn + M4",{"id":63,"goal":64,"preconditions":65,"steps":66,"result":26,"source":30,"firmware_min":26,"verified_on":26,"confidence":31},"copy","Duplicate one track's sound onto another track",[],[67,70],{"keys":68,"note":69,"set":26},"Tn + M2","hold the source track's key",{"keys":71,"note":72,"set":26},"Tm + M3","hold the destination track's key",[],[75,76,77],"instrument.save-to-same-snapshot","instrument.preset-browser","instrument.preset-management","These shortcuts act on a track's complete sound, preset settings included, without opening a menu.\nCopy and paste duplicate a sound onto another track for layering or variations; scramble throws the\nsettings around for happy accidents, so save first if you may want the original back. A save never\noverwrites: it adds a snapshot, unless you use the shift variant described in the related unit.",[80,82,84,85,87],{"url":30,"kind":81},"guide",{"url":41,"kind":83},"research",{"url":46,"kind":83},{"url":50,"kind":86},"changelog",{"url":54,"kind":86},[89,90,91,92,93,94,95,96,97,98,99],"track.1","track.2","track.3","track.4","track.5","track.6","track.7","track.8","key.m4","key.m2","key.m3",{"id":12,"title":101},"Instrument",{"id":77,"title":103},"Organise presets (cut, paste, rename, de